  "businessSummary": "AspireBoot is an open-source (MIT) .NET Aspire template that lets technical and non-technical builders start secure web products focused on business, shipping ready-made infrastructure (database, messaging, cache, object storage, email, HTTPS, observability) and full Identity-based accounts, profiles, sessions, user management and RBAC, with UI in pt/en/es. It targets single-VPS deployment by default (managed cloud optional), exposes an API for the bundled web frontend and a future mobile app, and a core premise is strong AI skills/instructions so assistants keep code maintainable, well-organized, performant, secure and aligned with the architecture.",
